{"type":"message","id":"dc62ab0d","parentId":"daf55515","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:07:01.160Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_yt2g557y5boy_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/[locale]/privacy/page.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/submit/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/admin/security/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/captcha/verify/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/captcha/generate/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/subscribe/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/components/ExampleHoneypotForm.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/security-middleware.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/audit-log.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/index.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/honeypot.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/categories.ts"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":237,"aggregated":"/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/[locale]/privacy/page.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/submit/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/admin/security/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/captcha/verify/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/captcha/generate/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/app/api/subscribe/route.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/components/ExampleHoneypotForm.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/security-middleware.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/audit-log.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/index.ts\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/security/honeypot.tsx\n/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/src/lib/categories.ts","cwd":"/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770970021156}}
{"type":"message","id":"54f50586","parentId":"dc62ab0d","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:07:05.395Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also add the needed environment variables documentation:","thinkingSignature":"96bdf1ff4132380315219ab9dbb152959dc71a5601868681ef3d1ff8e5da9f38"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jzteglapdx99_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Environment Variables\n\n## Required for Full Functionality\n\n### Redis (Upstash)\n\nFor production rate limiting with persistence:\n\n```env\nUPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-redis-url.upstash.io\nUPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_redis_token\n```\n\nGet your free Redis instance at https://upstash.com\n\n### Admin API Key\n\nFor security dashboard access:\n\n```env\nADMIN_API_KEY=your-secure-random-key\n```\n\nGenerate a secure key:\n```bash\nopenssl rand -base64 32\n```\n\n## Optional\n\n### Cloudflare Turnstile\n\nFor enhanced CAPTCHA (more user-friendly than text CAPTCHAs):\n\n```env\nCLOUDFLARE_TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=your_turnstile_secret\n```\n\nGet keys at https://www.cloudflare.com/products/turnstile/\n\n## Development\n\nFor local development without Redis, the system automatically falls back to in-memory storage.\n\n```env\n# Optional: Set a dev key\nADMIN_API_KEY=dev-key\n```\n","file_path":"/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/.env.example"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":31035,"output":271,"cacheRead":8454,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39760,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770970021160}}
