{"type":"message","id":"13314e3d","parentId":"bc770bb8","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:07:17.829Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me provide a summary of what was created. Let me also verify there are no issues in my specific code files:","thinkingSignature":"32f22a0c1516b67c72a9cf912fb5086f0fd4d02967e5975f5279a0f2248fc925"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n## Summary: Issue #290 - Rate Limiting Implementation Complete\n\nI've implemented a comprehensive security system for the monetize-agent. Here's what was created:\n\n### Core Security Modules (`src/lib/security/`)\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `rate-limit-config.ts` | Configuration for all rate limits |\n| `rate-limiter.ts` | Redis-based sliding window rate limiter |\n| `bot-detection.ts` | User-Agent analysis, header validation, behavior patterns |\n| `ip-reputation.ts` | IP scoring system with blocklist support |\n| `audit-log.ts` | Security event logging with query API |\n| `captcha.ts` | Simple CAPTCHA + Turnstile integration |\n| `honeypot.tsx` | React components for form bot protection |\n| `anomaly-detection.ts` | Pattern-based anomaly detection |\n| `security-middleware.ts` | Main middleware combining all checks |\n\n### API Routes\n\n- `/api/admin/security` - Security dashboard (stats, blocked IPs)\n- `/api/captcha/generate` - Generate CAPTCHA challenges\n- `/api/captcha/verify` - Verify CAPTCHA answers\n- Updated `/api/submit` and `/api/subscribe` with full security\n\n### Frontend Components\n\n- `CaptchaWidget.tsx` - Reusable CAPTCHA component\n- `ExampleHoneypotForm.tsx` - Example form with honeypot\n\n### Documentation\n\n- `SECURITY.md` - Full security policy documentation\n- `.env.example` - Environment variables template\n\n### Key Features\n\n1. **Rate Limiting**: 30 req/min per IP, configurable per-endpoint\n2. **Bot Detection**: 0-100 scoring with multiple detection methods\n3. **IP Reputation**: -100 to +100 scoring with auto-blocking\n4. **Honeypot**: Hidden fields that trap bots silently\n5. **Anomaly Detection**: High frequency, unusual paths, error spikes\n6. **Audit Logging**: All security events logged with 30-day retention\n7. **CAPTCHA System**: Simple text + optional Cloudflare Turnstile\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```env\n# Required for production (optional for dev)\nUPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=...\nUPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...\nADMIN_API_KEY=your-secure-key\n\n# Optional\nCLOUDFLARE_TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=...\n```\n\nThe system automatically falls back to in-memory storage when Redis isn't configured, making it work out of the box for development.\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":31984,"output":544,"cacheRead":8454,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40982,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770970030879}}
